Hi Mamum,

On Fri, Jun 18, 2010 at 12:25 PM, Mamun Rashid <mamunb...@gmail.com> wrote:
>
> Hi everyone,
> I am analysing some affymetrix exon array data. I have been performing some
> Quality checking of the  data. I have plotted the residulas from the plm fit of
